    "description": "Use a genuine observation from building or operating Vision to teach a broader lesson.",
    "psychologicalMechanism": "First-person specificity can create credibility and a human connection when the experience is real.",
    "whyItMayWork": "It lets the founder voice carry useful insight without turning every post into an advertisement.",
    "whenToUse": [
      "A genuine observation or experience exists.",
      "There is a useful lesson beyond self-promotion."
    ],
